        "original_id": "573fe760-0a81-5f31-961c-8c7c57211014",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tahmoh Penikett, Joss Whedon\n- Organizations: Mutant Enemy Productions, Bellwether Pictures\n- Television series: Supernatural, Dollhouse, Continuum, Buffy the Vampire Slayer, Angel, Firefly, Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D.\n\nFacts:\n- Joss Whedon created the television series Buffy the Vampire Slayer, which ran from 1997 to 2003.\n- Joss Whedon created the television series Angel, which ran from 1999 to 2004.\n- Joss Whedon created the television series Firefly, which premiered in 2002.\n- Joss Whedon co-founded Bellwether Pictures.\n- Joss Whedon founded Mutant Enemy Productions.\n- Joss Whedon created the television series Dollhouse, which ran from 2009 to 2010.\n- Tahmoh Penikett starred in the television series Dollhouse.\n- Tahmoh Penikett starred in the television series Supernatural.\n- Tahmoh Penikett starred in the Showtime time travel series Continuum.\n- Joss Whedon created the television series Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D., which began in 2013.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
